# Clinic OS

AI back-office for a specialty clinic. Staff upload a referral PDF, review the extract, approve, and watch a browser write the chart. Every write is gated by a human approval token.

## Layout on disk
- Screens: `apps/console/app/`
- Components: `apps/console/components/`
- Shared copy/status: `apps/console/lib/`
- Tokens: `packages/ui/console.css` (`--c-*` vars). Do not add Tailwind.

Do not invent API endpoints. If the backend does not have it, the UI says so.

## Status — one pill, these strings
`extracting` `awaiting_review` `ready` `fax_back` `needs_human` `ineligible` `failed`
`writing` `complete` `flagged` `rejected` `paused`
`submitted` `approved` `denied` (prior auth)
`drafted` `written` (scribe)

Use `<StatusPill status={...} />` and `lib/status.ts`. No other component invents status colors.

Labels: extracting → Reading fax; awaiting_review/ready → Ready for you; fax_back → Sent back; needs_human → Needs a person; ineligible → Ineligible; failed → Could not read; writing → Writing chart; complete → Complete; flagged → Flagged; rejected → Rejected; paused → Paused.

## Shell
- Rail 232px, no top bar. Main max-width 1100px (dashboard/schedule may go full width), padding 32px.
- Bricolage only for the sidebar wordmark and each page H1 (24px / 800). Everything else Instrument Sans. Mono for numbers, logs, codes.
- One `<Button>` (`primary` `secondary` `ghost` `danger` `danger-ghost`). One primary per screen.
- Lists: populated / empty (one-sentence next action) / loading skeleton.
- Mutations: button spinner + disabled. Failures: sticky toast with `E-###` from `lib/errors.ts`.
- App chrome uses `--c-*` in `packages/ui/console.css`. No `--c-viridian` in the console. STAT orange is pills only.

## Interaction
- Reject / Flag / Delete confirm with a modal that names the consequence.
- Esc closes drawers and modals. Focus ring on every control.
- Activity log is a product surface, never behind a toggle.
- No purple, orbs, sparkle, chat bubble, or "AI-powered" copy.
- Do not auto-approve or pre-check a box. Do not invent analytics.
- Do not redesign `synopsis.html`.
